  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx2 - √(9.76) x + 1 = 0\n\n**Concept used:**\n\nIf x + (1/x) = P\n\nx - (1/x) = √(P² - 4)\n\nIf x - 1/x = P then,\n\nx³ - 1/x³ = P³ + 3P\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ x2 - √(9.76) x + 1 = 0\n\nDivide by x on both sides\n\n⇒ x - √(9.76) + 1/x = 0\n\n⇒ x + 1/x = √(9.76)\n\nNow,\n\n⇒ x - 1/x = √{(√9.76)² - 4} \n\n⇒ √{9.76 - 4} = √5.76\n\n⇒ 2.4\n\nx³ - (1/x³) = {x - (1/x)}³ + 3 × {x - (1/x)}\n\n⇒ (2.4)³ + 3 × 2.4 \n\n⇒ 13.824 + 7.2\n\n⇒ 21.024\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 21.024.**",
